      "head": "{\"kind\":\"artifact\",\"artifact\":{\"title\":\"Stochastic Gradient Descent on a Loss Bowl: Learning Rate and Batch Size\",\"description\":\"A blue bowl-shaped surface shows the loss for two model settings, x and z. The bowl is steeper along x than along z, and its lowest point is at the centre. A red ball is the current guess. An orange arrow on the ball shows the next mini-batch step. A grey arrow shows the step the full data set would take. An orange trail marks where the ball lands after each step, up to 40 steps. A faded navy ghost trail shows a kept earlier run. Readouts show the step number, the true loss, the length of the mini-batch step and the run status.\",\"experience\":\"experiment\",\"behavior\":\"rules\",\"controlProfile\":\"inspect\",\"stepped\":true,\"scene\":{\"materials\":[{\"id\":\"bowlBlue\",\"color\":\"#9fb4d0\"},{\"id\":\"ballRed\",\"color\":\"#d0342c\"},{\"id\":\"pathOrange\",\"color\":\"#e8731a\"},{\"id\":\"ghostNavy\",\"color\":\"#24407e\"},{\"id\":\"trueGrey\",\"color\":\"#555b63\"},{\"id\":\"dotDark\",\"color\":\"#2e333b\"}],\"geometries\":[{\"id\":\"bowlGrid\",\"kind\":\"surface\",\"width\":4,\"depth\":4,\"contours\":8,\"heights\":[[3.2,2.8,2.44,2.11,1.82,1.57,1.35,1.17,1.02,0.91,0.84,0.81,0.81,0.84,0.91,1.02,1.17,1.35,1.57,1.82,2.11,2.44,2.8,3.2],[3.07,2.67,2.31,1.98,1.69,1.43,1.22,1.03,0.89,0.78,0.71,0.67,0.67,0.71,0.78,0.89,1.03,1.22,1.43,1.69,1.98,2.31,2.67,3.07],[2.95,2.55,2.18,1.86,1.57,1.31,1.1,0.91,0.77,0.66,0.59,0.55,0.55,0.59,0.66,0.77,0.91,1.1,1.31,1.57,1.86,2.18,2.55,2.95],[2.84,2.44,2.08,1.75,1.46,1.2,0.99,0.8,0.66,0.55,0.48,0.44,0.44,0.48,0.55,0.66,0.8,0.99,1.2,1.46,1.75,2.08,2.44,2.84],[2.74,2.34,1.98,1.65,1.36,1.11,0.89,0.71,0.56,0.45,0.38,0.35,0.35,0.38,0.45,0.56,0.71,0.89,1.11,1.36,1.65,1.98,2.34,2.74],[2.66,2.26,1.89,1.57,1.28,1.02,0.81,0.62,0.48,0.37,0.3,0.26,0.26,0.3,0.37,0.48,0.62,0.81,1.02,1.28,1.57,1.89,2.26,2.66],[2.58,2.18,1.82,1.49,1.2,0.95,0.73,0.55,0.41,0.3,0.22,0.19,0.19,0.22,0.3,0.41,0.55,0